  "post_content": "<p style=\"border: 0px; font-family: 'Source Sans Pro', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin: 0px 0px 1.5em; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; word-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(86, 89, 94); line-height: 26.6px;\">(14 fotos) El equipo veterano del CF Racing Onda Veteranos ha participado el &uacute;ltimo fin de semana, los d&iacute;as 27 y 28, en el Torneo Veteranos Gran Casino Castell&oacute;n, organizado por PINOSPORT, en el que &nbsp;se ha enfrentado contra la Real Sociedad,CD Castell&oacute;n y Girona CF.</p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/racingondatrofeuveteransgrancasinocs/20151128_095754.jpg\" alt=\"20151128_095754\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/racingondatrofeuveteransgrancasinocs/equipoveteranosracingonda.png\" alt=\"equipoveteranosracingonda\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/racingondatrofeuveteransgrancasinocs/img-20151128-wa0002.jpg\" alt=\"img-20151128-wa0002\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/racingondatrofeuveteransgrancasinocs/img-20151128-wa0003.jpg\" alt=\"img-20151128-wa0003\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/racingondatrofeuveteransgrancasinocs/img-20151128-wa0004.jpg\" alt=\"img-20151128-wa0004\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/racingondatrofeuveteransgrancasinocs/img-20151128-wa0009.jpg\" alt=\"img-20151128-wa0009\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/racingondatrofeuveteransgrancasinocs/img-20151128-wa0011.jpg\" alt=\"img-20151128-wa0011\" style=\"max-wi